{
  "id": 404314491,
  "iid": 20754,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "ICMP: introduce ICMP data for ICMP echo",
  "description": "Create a proto tree item representing all ICMP echo data, also the data\nthat may be interpreted as a timestamp. When it is determined the\ntimestamp is not available add the data as usual, but for consistency,\nadding the ICMP data item as well.\nTherefore for any ICMP echo packet 'icmp.data' represents all bytes in\nthe ICMP data field, while 'data.data' represents these same bytes\nexcept for the optional timestamp.\n\nFixes #20329",
